WEBVTT

00:12.846 --> 00:14.305
When I was in third grade,

00:14.389 --> 00:17.142
I beat up a high school student
who was being arrogant.

00:17.225 --> 00:18.143
WRITING, MATHEMATICS

00:22.063 --> 00:25.734
He may be older than me,
but arrogance is arrogance.

00:26.359 --> 00:28.653
When others look down on me…

00:31.823 --> 00:34.534
and I can feel that they
are looking down on me,

00:34.617 --> 00:37.912
the bell that indicates
the start of a fight starts ringing.

00:38.830 --> 00:40.707
It's nothing interesting, really.

00:40.790 --> 00:44.586
Beating up a boring guy
is still going to be boring.

00:47.881 --> 00:48.882
What?

00:51.509 --> 00:53.303
What kind of woman…

00:54.220 --> 00:55.513
do you like?

00:56.765 --> 00:58.433
Who are you?

01:00.310 --> 01:02.562
I had a feeling that…

01:02.645 --> 01:04.647
I wouldn't feel bored anymore.

02:47.876 --> 02:50.795
It's time to unleash my cursed technique.

02:50.879 --> 02:51.754
What?

02:51.838 --> 02:53.381
Didn't you use it before?

02:53.464 --> 02:57.552
However, I don't have time
to explain it in detail now.

02:57.635 --> 03:00.680
I can only tell you one thing…

03:01.264 --> 03:02.348
Don't stop.

03:03.016 --> 03:04.434
Believe in me!

03:05.560 --> 03:06.728
Only two things, right?

03:09.147 --> 03:11.274
Let me review its moves.

03:12.275 --> 03:14.527
Roots emerge from the ground.

03:14.611 --> 03:18.072
I believe that the smaller the scale,

03:18.156 --> 03:20.074
the stronger and faster it would be.

03:20.658 --> 03:21.951
Wooden Ball.

03:22.035 --> 03:25.121
Each Wooden Ball can launch
one or two attacks.

03:25.204 --> 03:26.915
Then it will disappear.

03:26.998 --> 03:29.959
I need to watch the time gap
since it can be controlled midair.

03:30.043 --> 03:31.461
Cursed Bud.

03:31.544 --> 03:33.963
I think Fushiguro got hit by that.

03:34.047 --> 03:36.382
Will it be over
if they plant it into someone?

03:36.466 --> 03:39.219
If so, I hope there's a limit
to how many it can use.

03:39.719 --> 03:40.887
Flower Field.

03:40.970 --> 03:43.097
It can distract his opponents.

03:43.181 --> 03:45.433
But my injury is making me focus better.

03:45.516 --> 03:47.227
I don't need to be too wary of that.

03:47.310 --> 03:50.730
Not to forget the left arm it revealed.

03:52.857 --> 03:56.236
Also, the possibility that
everything could be a disguise!

03:56.319 --> 03:58.488
But regardless of its cursed technique,

03:58.571 --> 04:01.032
I'll just prevent it from using it.

04:02.075 --> 04:04.369
Considering this
is an emergency situation,

04:04.452 --> 04:07.497
my IQ of 530,000…

04:10.083 --> 04:14.087
and my CPU brain has concluded
that the outcome should be…

04:20.093 --> 04:23.304
Why? Because I'm not alone.

04:26.099 --> 04:27.892
Because you're here!

04:29.435 --> 04:30.270
What?

04:37.360 --> 04:38.194
Todo!

04:44.784 --> 04:45.868
Todo!

04:48.371 --> 04:50.290
First one down.

04:59.841 --> 05:01.467
What…

05:01.551 --> 05:02.677
What?

05:02.760 --> 05:03.761
Todo!

05:03.845 --> 05:05.388
I see.

05:05.471 --> 05:07.056
It's so simple.

05:08.558 --> 05:11.185
Therefore, it's a troublesome
cursed technique.

05:11.269 --> 05:16.232
Yes, my cursed technique allows me
to trade places with someone else.

05:16.316 --> 05:17.692
Boogie Woogie!

05:19.569 --> 05:20.862
Todo.

05:21.738 --> 05:24.324
Eliminate the opponent first
before it adjusts to it.

05:27.702 --> 05:33.333
By the way,
clapping is the way to activate it!

05:47.263 --> 05:49.057
Their physical differences…

05:49.140 --> 05:51.350
feel more significant
after trading places.

05:54.604 --> 05:59.025
Am I the object of the trade,
or is it Sukuna's vessel?

05:59.525 --> 06:02.070
When he claps his hand,
I'm forced to choose either one.

06:02.153 --> 06:03.821
It slows down my judgment.

06:09.285 --> 06:11.412
Not good. This is…

06:29.472 --> 06:31.432
I can't escape!

06:37.772 --> 06:39.273
It's coming again!

06:42.527 --> 06:45.696
Continuous use of Black Flash
isn't amazing at all.

06:49.617 --> 06:52.286
It is hard to use it more than twice

06:52.370 --> 06:55.456
unless unleashed consecutively
on the same day.

06:55.540 --> 06:59.585
The reason behind the first success
might be one's luck or capability.

06:59.669 --> 07:01.337
After using Black Flash,

07:01.420 --> 07:06.467
a sorcerer will enter the zone,
similar to what athletes experience.

07:06.551 --> 07:12.348
The thinking process revolving around
sorcery becomes as easy as breathing.

07:12.432 --> 07:15.518
You feel like
you're the center of everything,

07:15.601 --> 07:17.311
and that you're omnipotent.

07:17.812 --> 07:19.981
I guess it can be described like this?

07:21.232 --> 07:23.484
My record, you ask?

07:26.654 --> 07:28.030
Four times.

07:28.614 --> 07:30.992
It was just pure luck.

07:37.415 --> 07:38.708
Black Flash!

07:39.208 --> 07:40.376
Brother.

07:40.460 --> 07:43.129
You always give me this premonition.

07:51.304 --> 07:52.263
Black Flash.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.519
Black Flash.

07:59.103 --> 08:01.022
Three times in a row.

08:01.606 --> 08:03.274
Don't get ahead of yourself!

08:05.943 --> 08:06.986
Trading places?

08:07.069 --> 08:09.113
I should be careful of…

08:09.655 --> 08:11.032
Sukuna's…

08:12.950 --> 08:14.243
They didn't change places!

08:18.748 --> 08:23.252
Clapping my hands doesn't mean
that I'll activate the cursed technique.

08:23.336 --> 08:27.006
It's simple, but you fell for it.

08:27.507 --> 08:29.425
It's the same as before.

08:30.384 --> 08:33.221
I have a feeling that
I wouldn't feel bored anymore!

08:38.100 --> 08:39.894
Black Flash.

09:22.770 --> 09:24.480
It attacked right after the switch.

09:24.564 --> 09:27.858
Looks like it's getting used to
Todo's cursed technique.

09:28.484 --> 09:31.988
But the continuous Black Flash
just now was effective.

09:32.488 --> 09:35.116
Both of us can exorcise it!

09:36.200 --> 09:40.246
This is the first time in my life
I've suffered such a serious injury.

09:40.955 --> 09:43.124
Even so…

09:45.042 --> 09:48.629
The thrill of fighting
has not disappeared!

10:06.606 --> 10:09.233
The explanation of his
cursed technique seems phony.

10:09.775 --> 10:13.529
Can he trade other people's places
besides himself?

10:13.613 --> 10:14.864
Todo!

10:15.698 --> 10:17.783
He tried to protect me…

10:17.867 --> 10:20.536
Don't worry, brother.

10:21.287 --> 10:25.041
If I defend with my body
and cursed energy,

10:25.625 --> 10:27.460
this level of Cursed Buds…

10:27.960 --> 10:30.254
I'll deflect them all.

10:36.260 --> 10:37.970
Are you sure?

10:40.931 --> 10:43.309
Takada?

10:44.935 --> 10:48.731
Do you remember Fushiguro's wound?

10:48.814 --> 10:50.483
Of course!

10:50.566 --> 10:53.736
My opponent is shooting
Cursed Buds at me now.

10:53.819 --> 10:54.862
That's why I…

10:54.945 --> 10:56.197
However,

10:56.697 --> 11:00.117
the buds inside Fushiguro
grew a little, right?

11:03.954 --> 11:07.208
Did it grow because it absorbed his blood?

11:07.291 --> 11:09.210
It could be.

11:09.293 --> 11:11.879
But his opponent was a Cursed Spirit.

11:12.463 --> 11:15.049
What is the most possible reason?

11:19.887 --> 11:21.347
Cursed energy.

11:21.430 --> 11:22.848
TOOK PLACE FOR 0.01 SECONDS

11:30.064 --> 11:32.274
He withdrew his cursed energy
at the last moment!

11:32.358 --> 11:33.526
Did he find out about it?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.821
The stronger the protective cursed energy,

11:36.904 --> 11:39.198
the bigger the Cursed Buds will grow.

11:39.865 --> 11:42.368
Is the NHE coming soon?

11:42.451 --> 11:44.370
NHE, NATIONAL HANDSHAKE EVENT

11:44.453 --> 11:46.789
I must express my gratitude to her.

11:47.373 --> 11:48.457
Right?

11:58.008 --> 11:59.927
Special Grade Cursed Spirit.

12:00.970 --> 12:05.266
You should have noticed
that my explanation was incomplete.

12:05.891 --> 12:10.646
But you still need
to consider one more thing.

12:10.729 --> 12:13.566
That is the target of Boogie Woogie.

12:14.900 --> 12:19.780
Can I only switch the positions
of living creatures within my range?

12:21.282 --> 12:25.369
My cursed technique works on anything,
including Cursed Corpses!

12:25.453 --> 12:27.329
So the answer is…

12:27.955 --> 12:31.125
it works on anything
with enough cursed energy!

12:33.919 --> 12:36.714
Special Grade Cursed Spirit,
have you noticed?

12:37.840 --> 12:41.427
We're back to the same place.

12:41.510 --> 12:44.597
That thing is sleeping inside!

12:50.269 --> 12:53.481
Maki's Special Grade Cursed Tool
is under the river.

12:54.440 --> 12:57.067
The tree branches on its face
are particularly fragile.

13:00.404 --> 13:01.739
The river?

13:02.448 --> 13:05.284
What did I switch positions with?

13:07.119 --> 13:09.121
Special Grade Cursed Tool.

13:15.920 --> 13:17.213
Playful Cloud!

13:25.471 --> 13:28.933
I imbued my cursed energy
on this Special Grade Cursed Tool,

13:29.016 --> 13:30.809
but I still can't exorcise it.

13:30.893 --> 13:31.894
What?

13:44.073 --> 13:47.243
Plants cannot breed cursed energy.

13:47.826 --> 13:51.497
My left hand can absorb
life from other plants

13:52.122 --> 13:54.625
and convert it into cursed energy.

13:56.085 --> 13:59.380
The cursed energy won't recharge my body.

13:59.463 --> 14:02.508
However, it will flow into this flower.

14:02.591 --> 14:05.594
I didn't want to use this, if possible.

14:14.103 --> 14:15.104
Todo!

14:15.187 --> 14:16.480
Don't come here, brother!

14:16.564 --> 14:18.774
This output of cursed energy
is extraordinary.

14:18.857 --> 14:23.612
It's easy for you to avoid it
using your cursed technique.

14:24.113 --> 14:26.407
In that case, what should I do?

14:27.575 --> 14:29.159
Domain--

14:31.996 --> 14:32.997
The Veil…

15:00.608 --> 15:02.276
I see.

15:02.776 --> 15:06.030
I was wondering how can he be
so loud without loudspeakers.

15:06.697 --> 15:09.366
This old man is a loudspeaker himself.

15:09.450 --> 15:14.371
His cursed technique amplifies
the music he plays and launches it.

15:15.247 --> 15:17.625
A predictable mid-range fighter.

15:17.708 --> 15:20.544
He obviously doesn't want me
to go near him.

15:23.255 --> 15:25.215
I'll make a wallet then.

15:25.299 --> 15:27.927
A wallet filled with an old man's smell.

15:34.016 --> 15:35.184
Understood.

15:35.267 --> 15:37.603
Go and meet with Shoko, Nishimiya.

15:40.105 --> 15:43.025
It's okay, Mei Mei will look after Miwa.

15:46.278 --> 15:48.322
Luckily, reception is still
working on phones.

15:48.405 --> 15:51.200
This is normal
due to the nature of the Veil.

15:51.909 --> 15:53.452
Someone in Jujutsu High School…

15:53.535 --> 15:56.330
is colluding with
Cursed Users or Cursed Spirits.

15:57.623 --> 15:59.833
Looks like it's not a misunderstanding.

16:01.835 --> 16:02.670
What?

16:06.256 --> 16:09.051
I thought I got you.

16:10.010 --> 16:11.303
A human?

16:11.929 --> 16:13.013
Is he a Curse User?

16:15.265 --> 16:17.309
This is why…

16:20.145 --> 16:22.606
Looks pretty good, right?

16:24.066 --> 16:26.402
Juzo made this for me.

16:27.403 --> 16:29.154
Didn't you see him just now?

16:30.322 --> 16:34.660
You are weak,
so let the katana support you.

16:35.244 --> 16:36.286
That's what he said.

16:38.998 --> 16:42.584
What can you give me, miss?

16:43.127 --> 16:45.921
-You're not popular with girls, right?
-What?

16:46.005 --> 16:49.425
We've only just met,
and you keep talking about yourself.

16:50.050 --> 16:51.260
I'm charging you money.

16:51.343 --> 16:55.472
Are you qualified to charge people
for being their listener?

16:56.265 --> 16:59.226
-You guys!
-Shut up! Don't argue with me!

16:59.309 --> 17:00.144
What?

17:00.853 --> 17:02.271
Gosh!

17:02.354 --> 17:06.400
There are so many girls! I'm so popular!

17:07.192 --> 17:09.319
Are you listening to us?

17:09.403 --> 17:11.280
I'll be the support.

17:11.363 --> 17:13.532
Be careful not to get shot by mistake.

17:13.615 --> 17:15.492
You should be careful!

17:23.083 --> 17:24.501
The Veil is lifted?

17:25.085 --> 17:29.214
Really? It's not even 30 minutes.

17:29.298 --> 17:30.716
I'm running!

17:32.509 --> 17:35.262
What's wrong with him?

17:38.182 --> 17:41.060
Hey!

17:42.978 --> 17:46.607
The dazzling clothing rack
is right in front of my eyes.

17:49.443 --> 17:50.778
Now then…

17:50.861 --> 17:52.696
Where should I start?

17:56.241 --> 17:57.493
Is that…

18:02.414 --> 18:05.292
Seems like this is as far as we get.

18:05.918 --> 18:06.752
What?

18:06.835 --> 18:08.295
Mr. Gojo?

18:17.179 --> 18:18.555
Yuji's level…

18:19.431 --> 18:21.558
He has greatly improved.

18:22.559 --> 18:24.895
I see. It must be Aoi.

18:25.395 --> 18:27.898
He really works well with Yuji.

18:28.440 --> 18:30.818
Looks like they are fighting
a Special Grade.

18:30.901 --> 18:32.569
I shouldn't worry about them.

18:33.612 --> 18:36.198
In that case, my priority would be…

18:38.492 --> 18:39.660
You.

18:40.244 --> 18:43.247
Clothing rack!

18:43.330 --> 18:45.124
Don't kill him!

18:55.008 --> 18:57.469
I have many questions to ask him.

18:58.428 --> 19:00.305
Don't let him die.

19:00.389 --> 19:01.974
Come on, heal him.

19:07.062 --> 19:10.649
The Curse User who attacked
Utahime has disappeared.

19:11.817 --> 19:13.986
Were they planning to escape all along?

19:14.987 --> 19:16.864
Is that the only one left?

19:17.447 --> 19:19.116
That one is good at escaping, too.

19:20.325 --> 19:22.703
This place is quite far away from Yuji.

19:23.203 --> 19:24.788
I have no choice.

19:25.455 --> 19:27.457
Let's be a little violent.

19:28.542 --> 19:30.961
Cursed Technique Lapse, Blue.

19:31.461 --> 19:33.714
Cursed Technique Reversal, Red.

19:37.718 --> 19:38.969
I'm withdrawing.

19:39.052 --> 19:42.639
I'm not conceited enough to believe
that I can take on Satoru Gojo.

19:42.723 --> 19:43.891
Are you serious?

19:43.974 --> 19:46.518
What are you trying to do?

19:47.519 --> 19:49.146
Wait a minute, brother!

19:49.229 --> 19:51.231
Todo, why are you stopping me?

19:53.025 --> 19:54.902
Don't get any closer.

19:58.488 --> 20:00.157
You'll be swept into it.

20:03.994 --> 20:05.162
Hollow…

20:08.540 --> 20:09.750
Purple.

20:36.693 --> 20:38.946
He's still beyond common sense, as always.

20:39.029 --> 20:40.280
Gosh…

20:41.156 --> 20:44.493
I can't even tell if the Cursed Spirit
was exorcised or not.

20:45.369 --> 20:47.246
It hurts!

20:47.329 --> 20:48.872
It hurts so much!

20:48.956 --> 20:50.040
Shut up!

20:50.123 --> 20:51.583
All right!

20:51.667 --> 20:53.627
Everything's resolved!

20:55.212 --> 20:58.006
Of course, it's not that simple.

21:07.015 --> 21:09.059
I wonder if Hanami is okay.

21:10.143 --> 21:12.479
Mission accomplished.

22:46.448 --> 22:48.366
-Juju Stroll.
-Salmon.

22:48.450 --> 22:49.993
ARE YOU A DOG OR A CAT PERSON?

22:50.577 --> 22:51.620
I'm a dog person.

22:52.245 --> 22:54.664
No, maybe I'm a cat person.

22:55.165 --> 22:57.834
Wait a minute.
I'll choose dog if it's a large one.

22:58.752 --> 22:59.586
Dogs.

22:59.669 --> 23:01.379
I think dogs.

23:01.463 --> 23:03.632
What? I'm definitely a cat person.

23:04.216 --> 23:05.175
Salmon.

23:05.258 --> 23:09.262
Of course, I'm a panda person!
Do you want me to kill you?

23:10.847 --> 23:16.895
Does everyone dislike me?

23:16.978 --> 23:19.397
No. It's just that
there are only two options.

23:19.481 --> 23:20.857
Ignore him.

23:25.904 --> 23:27.364
NOBARA KUGISAKI, THIRD BASEMAN
